# codex.md is a local-only progress snapshot generated by
# `npm run progress:codex` from PROGRESS.md + current git state. It must
# stay out of git: any committed snapshot is by construction one commit
# behind (it can't reference its own commit hash), which made review
# tools mistakenly flag it as "stale" on every push. The Codex / Claude
# session-start workflow should regenerate it locally.
/codex.md
